v0.4.1.9001
===========
* data.frame with regex matches needs to be modified such that it does not break if no matches
* precautionary check in $make_body() to avoid empty paragraphs
* dependency on gsubfn (function strapplyc) has been dropped

v0.4.1
======
* new method $detect_stage_instructions
* all methods have been renamed to snake_case
* all params renamed to snake_case
* params to methods moved to fields, to reduce necessity to document params
* maxLengthWho argument replaced by field $speaker_maximum_nchar_name
* method $show_nchar_histogram() moved to auxiliary function hist_nchar()


